1
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:36,703
<i>Why are you so obsessed with my daughter?</i>

2
00:00:36,786 --> 00:00:40,206
Because she's done what you never could.

3
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:58,266
I'm going to make La Morte Bianca pay.

4
00:00:58,349 --> 00:01:01,352
- Can we hear the plan first?
- Mikoy, we're out of time.

5
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:03,563
Should I wait until La Morte Bianca

6
00:01:03,646 --> 00:01:05,774
sends me my parents' heads?

7
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:09,569
How did La Morte Bianca know
where we were?

8
00:01:09,652 --> 00:01:11,780
How did she know where to send the box?

9
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:17,786
How else do you explain what happened?

10
00:01:17,869 --> 00:01:20,371
Someone is feeding information
to the enemy.

11
00:03:05,977 --> 00:03:07,854
Sorry for this, my love.

12
00:03:14,152 --> 00:03:15,904
Just kill Viktor and me.

13
00:03:16,654 --> 00:03:19,032
Aren't you allergic to traitors?

14
00:03:19,115 --> 00:03:21,159
And you're trigger-happy, right?

15
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,120
Where's your courage?

16
00:03:51,397 --> 00:03:53,650
You really are a shameless woman.

17
00:03:54,275 --> 00:03:55,985
I would love to shave your head!

18
00:03:56,569 --> 00:03:58,154
Remember this until the afterlife.

19
00:03:58,238 --> 00:04:00,990
I will never let your soul rest.
Remember that!

20
00:05:11,936 --> 00:05:14,981
So I crossed from one safe house
to another,

21
00:05:15,064 --> 00:05:16,941
until I got here.

22
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:24,115
To be honest,

23
00:05:24,198 --> 00:05:26,993
I never really planned
on bringing you along.

24
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:38,421
Who knows? I might survive.

25
00:05:39,505 --> 00:05:43,051
And you have no idea how excited I am

26
00:05:56,481 --> 00:05:57,690
And

27
00:05:58,691 --> 00:06:03,654
it's a plus that I get to work
with my master Mikoy again.

28
00:06:17,668 --> 00:06:20,379
and that's what we need to focus on.

29
00:06:25,968 --> 00:06:29,430
Her hideout is too well-hidden
and too private.

30
00:06:31,641 --> 00:06:33,810
The area also has limited entry points.

31
00:06:33,893 --> 00:06:37,230
I believe this is where
Los Bandidos entered.

32
00:06:45,822 --> 00:06:48,366
There isn't a place
where she can't hear us.

33
00:08:08,738 --> 00:08:12,325
<i>You thought I was dead?</i>

34
00:09:54,135 --> 00:09:58,848
<i>I've memorized your every move.</i>

35
00:10:37,136 --> 00:10:41,682
Let's see if you can fight in the dark.

36
00:10:41,766 --> 00:10:43,684
Show me your cat-like abilities.

37
00:11:21,055 --> 00:11:23,015
Let's go. You stay here.

38
00:11:23,099 --> 00:11:23,933
‪All right.

39
00:15:35,768 --> 00:15:37,853
Go ahead. I'll take care of things here.

40
00:15:39,355 --> 00:15:40,564
As if I would.

41
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,785
Support Chiara. We'll cover you.

42
00:19:01,807 --> 00:19:03,100
You talk too much!

43
00:19:45,184 --> 00:19:48,103
In Tagalog, One bullet is all it takes.

44
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:49,062
Mikoy.

45
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,565
This is my fight.

46
00:20:07,497 --> 00:20:10,375
Hey, stop, or I will really kill you.

47
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:29,853
Mikoy, don't!

48
00:21:49,433 --> 00:21:52,227
We coordinated
with the Italian authorities.

49
00:21:52,311 --> 00:21:55,230
But for now, they are being silent.

50
00:21:57,899 --> 00:22:00,861
But most of them got caught
or are on the run.

51
00:22:00,944 --> 00:22:05,490
So is it safe to say that we successfully
destroyed the Concordat?

52
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:12,998
<i>Where is Mikoy and Chiara?</i>

53
00:22:17,336 --> 00:22:20,130
<i>Catching a fish is not the only thing</i>
<i>you can learn from Chiara.</i>

54
00:22:20,714 --> 00:22:23,258
But also catching Mikoy's heart.

55
00:22:25,886 --> 00:22:30,348
Well, you know,
sometimes boring is better.

56
00:22:32,476 --> 00:22:34,895
<i>Think about the things</i>
<i>we've experienced this year.</i>

57
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:38,982
I've had enough of action
and adventure, sweetheart.

58
00:22:39,066 --> 00:22:43,028
All I wanted is a boring life.

59
00:22:43,945 --> 00:22:45,072
That's all.
